    "custom_liquid_DDicKx": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "name": "t:sections.custom-liquid.presets.name",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<!-- Horizontal Scrollable Reviews Section (10 Reviews, Mobile-Friendly) -->\n<div class=\"reviews-section\" style=\"max-width:1000px; margin:50px auto; font-family:Arial, sans-serif;\">\n  <h2 style=\"font-size:28px; font-weight:bold; text-align:center; margin-bottom:30px; color:#111827;\">What Our Customers Are Saying</h2>\n\n  <div class=\"reviews-scroller\">\n    {% assign reviews = \n      \"Emily Thompson|UK|Absolutely love it! Brings back so many memories and the kids can’t get enough. Perfect gift for the holidays.,\n      Michael Johnson|US|A fantastic console! Compact easy to use and brings so much fun. My friends and I are hooked.,\n      Sarah Williams|UK|Bought this as a gift for my nephew and he’s obsessed! Quality is excellent and so easy to play anywhere.,\n      Daniel Smith|US|Excellent retro gaming console. Perfect size for travel and it’s so fun to use with friends. Highly recommend.,\n      Olivia Brown|UK|Incredible gift idea. Everyone loved it and the kids are glued to it. Very happy with this purchase.,\n      James Miller|US|Perfect for my kids and also a nostalgic trip for me. Easy to use and extremely fun.,\n      Chloe Davis|UK|Amazing console! The retro games are fantastic and the device feels very premium. Highly recommended.,\n      Sophie Taylor|UK|Fantastic quality and so many games included. Perfect present for any retro gaming fan.,\n      Ethan Wilson|US|My friends and I can’t stop playing! Fun and nostalgic. Great purchase.\" | split: \",\" %}\n\n    {% for review in reviews %}\n      {% assign parts = review | strip | split:\"|\" %}\n      <div class=\"review-card\">\n        <div class=\"stars\">★★★★★</div>\n        <p>{{ parts[2] | strip }}</p>\n        <p class=\"reviewer\">— {{ parts[0] | strip }}, {{ parts[1] | strip }} <span>Verified Purchaser</span></p>\n      </div>\n    {% endfor %}\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<style>\n  .reviews-scroller {\n    display:flex;\n    gap:20px;\n    overflow-x:auto;\n    scroll-behavior:smooth;\n    scroll-snap-type: x mandatory;\n    -webkit-overflow-scrolling: touch;\n    padding-bottom:10px;\n  }\n\n  .review-card {\n    min-width:280px;\n    max-width:300px;\n    background:#f9fafb;\n    padding:20px;\n    border-radius:16px;\n    box-shadow:0 5px 15px rgba(0,0,0,0.05);\n    flex-shrink:0;\n    scroll-snap-align: start;\n  }\n\n  .stars {\n    color:#fbbf24;\n    font-size:18px;\n    margin-bottom:10px;\n  }\n\n  .review-card p {\n    line-height:1.6;\n    margin-bottom:10px;\n    color:#1f2937;\n  }\n\n  .reviewer span {\n    color:#10b981;\n    font-weight:normal;\n  }\n\n  .reviews-scroller::-webkit-scrollbar {\n    display:none;\n  }\n  .reviews-scroller {\n    -ms-overflow-style:none;\n    scrollbar-width:none;\n  }\n\n  @media (max-width:768px) {\n    .review-card {\n      min-width:100%;\n      max-width:100%;\n    }\n  }\n</style>",
        "color_scheme": "",
        "padding_top": 40,
        "padding_bottom": 52
      }
    },
    "multicolumn_FHkHdg": {
      "type": "multicolumn",
      "blocks": {
        "column_ngtLVN": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Testimonial_Image1_3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>The Perfect Nightlights</h3><p>These are great night lights. Love that they offer a dimmer slide on them to control brightness and they look very nice throughout our home. The color is very nice, the size is perfect and they aren't heavy in weight, but don't feel cheap at all. The price point is perfect.<br/>We have had them for a few weeks and they seem very durable and function quite well in our main living room and hallways.<br/>We have had nightlights since our 11 year old was just a baby and now that she is almost a teen, the sophisticated look that these provide are great and still serve the purpose they were created for, to provide light. We love having them for sleepovers for her friends, so no one is stumbling around in the dark looking for the bathroom or the stairs. Highly recommend.</p><p><strong>- Jacob C.</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_XEJ9wK": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Testimonial_Image2_3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Nice Upgrade for Decor Lighting</h3><p>I like how I can change the strength of the light. Good for bathrooms, kitchens, etc. sometimes you just don’t want bright light when walking into the bathroom and this can give you a good lighting that doesn’t hurt your eyes.</p><p><strong>- Shirley R.</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "column_n6BUk7": {
          "type": "column",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Testimonial_Image3_3.webp",
            "title": "⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐",
            "text": "<h3>Home Elevation - Check!</h3><p>I am in LOVE with these nightlights! I have purchased 6 in total. I love the ‘spotlight’ look and how they nicely light up the hallway, bathroom, and kitchen for when anyone needs to get up at night. I love the dimming feature. I wish I could make them a bit warmer, but love them nonetheless! I love how they automatically turn on when it gets dark/dim. My sons all love them too. The price is amazing! The size doesn’t prevent you from plugging in something else into the outlet which is so great! Highly recommend!</p><p><strong>- Mary H.</strong></p>",
            "link_label": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        }
      },
      "block_order": [
        "column_ngtLVN",
        "column_XEJ9wK",
