          "settings": {
            "heading": "How many games are included?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The Retro Infinity Console comes pre-installed with <strong>over 20,000 classic games</strong>, covering favorites from NES, SNES, Sega, and more—no downloads or subscriptions required.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_PVbgxt": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Do I need an internet connection to play?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>No! All games are built-in, so you can play anytime, anywhere without Wi-Fi.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_art4Nw": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "What devices is it compatible with?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>It has a <strong>3.5\" IPS display</strong> for handheld play and supports <strong>USB-C charging</strong>. It’s fully portable, making it perfect for travel or home use.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_zrDAhQ": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How long does the battery last?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>The rechargeable lithium battery lasts <strong>up to 8 hours</strong> of continuous gaming on a single charge.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_q7EYTg": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Can I expand the memory?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Absolutely! It comes with <strong>64GB of storage</strong> and a MicroSD slot, allowing you to add more games if desired.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "collapsible_row_mDFYxH": {
          "type": "collapsible_row",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Is it suitable as a gift?",
            "icon": "none",
            "row_content": "<p>Definitely! Its <strong>compact size, versatile design, and vast game library</strong> make it a perfect gift for kids, friends, or nostalgic gamers.<br/><br/></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        }
      },
